      "passage": "Among the rewards awaiting anyone who sweeps the winter sky with ordinary binoculars ______ several star clusters bright enough to show dozens of members at a glance, their stars spread across the field of view like spilled sugar.",
      "question": "Which choice completes the text so that it conforms to the conventions of Standard English?",
